  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5751e45b3bc551448917ed569792a2a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 23
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: My name is Premou. I carry with me all the information about the terrible
    fate of Proima, our planet, that I could gather in\nthe little time that I had
    left.\n\nWe were visited by an advanced device from beyond the sky. We believe
    its job was to detect water and notify whatever\nspecies built it about its location.\nSoon
    after its arrival, red lights surrounded our whole planet, originating from their
    spaceships.\nIt took us too long to figure out what they were doing, but I doubt
    there was anything we could have done about it.\n\nThe temperatures began to
    rapidly rise, and our water evaporated at incredible speeds.\nOur best guess
    is that these invaders are capable of absorbing the water in the air without
    needing to enter the\natmosphere, and they do it by artificially boiling the
    planet below them.\n\nBefore we could even figure anything out, we were forced
    to retreat deep into the underground caves.\nOur cities crumbled to dust as the
    surface became dry and devoid of life.\n\nWe never had the chance to contact
    them. We never got to fight back. We never even saw how they looked.\nWe were
    killed without notice in such a quick and merciless way.\n\nIf anyone ever finds
    this, use this as a warning. Your planet might not be safe.\n\nPremou, last of
    the Povann.
